# Selenium / WebDriver configuration for Linux ARM devcontainer:
# - Disable Selenium Manager (it does not support aarch64 reliably)
# - Prefer Chromium/Chrome (with chromedriver) locally to avoid flaky geckodriver-on-QEMU
